{
  "project": {
    "name": "Backpack (Panelled)",
    "slug": "backpack-panel",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "engine": "fc",
    "description": {
      "en": "A simple panelled rucksack: a wrap body (front + base + back folded at the base), a long side/base gusset, a top flap that buckles shut, and two shoulder straps. The flap + strap buckles bridge to the Yantra4D `strap-buckle` solid. Fashion Cabinet owns the pack — dimensions, gusset depth, strap length; Yantra4D owns the buckles. FC-200 accessories capsule.\n\nOfficial visualizer and configurator: Fashion Cabinet",
      "es": "Una mochila panelada simple: un cuerpo envolvente (frente + base + espalda doblado en la base), un fuelle lateral/base largo, una tapa superior que cierra con hebilla y dos tirantes. Las hebillas de tapa y tirantes se puentean al sólido `strap-buckle` de Yantra4D. Fashion Cabinet posee la mochila; Yantra4D posee las hebillas.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Fashion Cabinet"
    },
    "difficulty": "advanced",
    "tags": [
      "backpack",
      "rucksack",
      "bag",
      "accessory",
      "hardware",
      "commons",
      "made-to-measure"
    ],
    "attribution": {
      "author": "Innovaciones MADFAM",
      "license": "LicenseRef-FC1-pending",
      "lineage": [
        {
          "source": "Original draft for Fashion Cabinet",
          "license": "original"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "modes": [
    {
      "id": "set",
      "label": {
        "en": "Full Backpack",
        "es": "Mochila completa"
      },
      "script_file": "main.py",
      "pieces": [
        "body",
        "gusset",
        "flap",
        "strap"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pieces": [
